# Python bytecode. Never source, never reviewable, and version-specific —
# the tree was carrying both cpython-312 and cpython-314 copies of every
# test module.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Deliberately NOT ignored: .dev/tasks/ and telemetry.jsonl are shared,
# durable records. The task directory is the audit trail, and
# runtime/github/workflows/telemetry.yml commits telemetry.jsonl at merge —
# ignoring either would silently break provenance and the quarterly review.
